  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "KAM-dev — campaign HQ",
  "excerpt": "Lean 4 + Mathlib formalization of the **Kolmogorov–Arnold–Moser theorem** in its positive-measure form: for a nearly-integrable real-analytic Hamiltonian H(θ, I) = h(I) + f(θ, I) with a Kolmogorov-nondegenerate h, most of phase space is filled by invariant Lagrangian tori that carry quasi-periodic motion with Diophantine frequencies, as soon as f is small enough."
 },
